---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Industries | AuditVerse AI"
  description="AuditVerse AI serves logistics, manufacturing, construction, trading and service industries."
  canonical="https://www.auditverseai.com/industries"
  activePage="industries"
>

<section class="page-hero on-dark">
  <div class="hero-grid-lines"></div>
  <div class="wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:2;">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Industries</span></div>
    <div class="eyebrow">Industries</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(32px,4.6vw,54px);font-weight:800;max-width:820px;line-height:1.1;">Automation built around how your industry actually operates</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:20px;">We don't sell one template to every client. Each industry we serve gets workflows, dashboards and controls shaped by how that business really runs.</p>
    <div class="badge-row" style="margin-top:26px;"><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Logistics</span><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Manufacturing</span><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Construction</span><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Trading</span><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Retail</span></div>
    
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head  reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Who We Serve</div>
        <h2 class="headline">Eleven industries, one automation standard</h2>
        
      </div>
      
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <a href="/contact" class="industry-card reveal">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1601584115197-04ecc0da31d7?q=80&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Logistics industry served by AuditVerse AI" loading="lazy">
        <div class="overlay"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="1" y="6" width="14" height="11"/><path d="M15 9h4l3 4v4h-7"/><circle cx="6" cy="19" r="2"/><circle cx="17" cy="19" r="2"/></svg> Logistics</h4></div>
      </a>
      <a href="/contact" class="industry-card reveal">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519003722824-194d4455a60c?q=80&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Transport industry served by AuditVerse AI" loading="lazy">
        <div class="overlay"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="1" y="6" width="14" height="11"/><path d="M15 9h4l3 4v4h-7"/><circle cx="6" cy="19" r="2"/><circle cx="17" cy="19" r="2"/></svg> Transport</h4></div>
      </a>
      <a href="/contact" class="industry-card reveal">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541976590-713941681591?q=80&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Construction industry served by AuditVerse AI" loading="lazy">
        <div class="overlay"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M4 18v-2a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v2"/><path d="M2 18h20"/><path d="M12 4v4"/></svg> Construction</h4></div>
      </a>
      <a href="/contact" class="industry-card reveal">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441986300917-64674bd600d8?q=80&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Retail industry served by AuditVerse AI" loading="lazy">
        <div class="overlay"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="9" cy="21" r="1"/><circle cx="19" cy="21" r="1"/><path d="M2 3h2l2.6 12.6a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.6h9a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.6L22 7H6"/></svg> Retail</h4></div>
      </a>
      <a href="/contact" class="industry-card reveal">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519494026892-80bbd2d6fd0d?q=80&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Healthcare industry served by AuditVerse AI" loading="lazy">
        <div class="overlay"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 2v6"/><path d="M9 5h6"/><rect x="4" y="8" width="16" height="14"/><path d="M9 22v-4h6v4"/></svg> Healthcare</h4></div>
      </a>
      <a href="/contact" class="industry-card reveal">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523050854058-8df90110c9f1?q=80&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Education industry served by AuditVerse AI" loading="lazy">
        <div class="overlay"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M22 10 12 5 2 10l10 5 10-5Z"/><path d="M6 12v5c0 1.1 2.7 2 6 2s6-.9 6-2v-5"/></svg> Education</h4></div>
      </a>
      <a href="/contact" class="industry-card reveal">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565608087341-404b25492fee?q=80&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Manufacturing industry served by AuditVerse AI" loading="lazy">
        <div class="overlay"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M2 20V9l6 4V9l6 4V6l6 4v10Z"/><path d="M2 20h20"/></svg> Manufacturing</h4></div>
      </a>
      <a href="/contact" class="industry-card reveal">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1454165804606-c3d57bc86b40?q=80&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Trading industry served by AuditVerse AI" loading="lazy">
        <div class="overlay"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/></svg> Trading</h4></div>
      </a>
      <a href="/contact" class="industry-card reveal">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1587293852726-70cdb56c2866?q=80&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Warehousing industry served by AuditVerse AI" loading="lazy">
        <div class="overlay"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M22 20V9l-10-6L2 9v11Z"/><path d="M6 20v-6h12v6"/></svg> Warehousing</h4></div>
      </a>
      <a href="/contact" class="industry-card reveal">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1566073771259-6a8506099945?q=80&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Hospitality industry served by AuditVerse AI" loading="lazy">
        <div class="overlay"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20"/><path d="M9 22v-4h6v4"/><path d="M9 6h1"/><path d="M14 6h1"/><path d="M9 10h1"/><path d="M14 10h1"/><path d="M9 14h1"/><path d="M14 14h1"/></svg> Hospitality</h4></div>
      </a>
      <a href="/contact" class="industry-card reveal">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541872703-74c5e44368f9?q=80&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Government industry served by AuditVerse AI" loading="lazy">
        <div class="overlay"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M3 21h18"/><path d="M5 21V9"/><path d="M19 21V9"/><path d="M3 9l9-6 9 6"/><path d="M9 21v-7"/><path d="M15 21v-7"/></svg> Government</h4></div>
      </a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head  reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Industry Deep Dives</div>
        <h2 class="headline">What automation looks like in your sector</h2>
        
      </div>
      
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="card card-dark reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="1" y="6" width="14" height="11"/><path d="M15 9h4l3 4v4h-7"/><circle cx="6" cy="19" r="2"/><circle cx="17" cy="19" r="2"/></svg></div><h4>Logistics</h4><p>Fleet automation, route costing and freight reconciliation for logistics operators managing thin margins at scale.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card card-dark reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="1" y="6" width="14" height="11"/><path d="M15 9h4l3 4v4h-7"/><circle cx="6" cy="19" r="2"/><circle cx="17" cy="19" r="2"/></svg></div><h4>Transport</h4><p>Vehicle maintenance scheduling, fuel reconciliation and driver payroll automation.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card card-dark reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M4 18v-2a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v2"/><path d="M2 18h20"/><path d="M12 4v4"/></svg></div><h4>Construction</h4><p>Project costing, retention tracking and subcontractor payment automation for construction groups.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card card-dark reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="9" cy="21" r="1"/><circle cx="19" cy="21" r="1"/><path d="M2 3h2l2.6 12.6a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.6h9a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.6L22 7H6"/></svg></div><h4>Retail</h4><p>Point-of-sale reconciliation, inventory automation and multi-branch reporting for retail chains.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card card-dark reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 2v6"/><path d="M9 5h6"/><rect x="4" y="8" width="16" height="14"/><path d="M9 22v-4h6v4"/></svg></div><h4>Healthcare</h4><p>Billing automation, insurance claims reconciliation and compliance reporting for healthcare providers.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card card-dark reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M22 10 12 5 2 10l10 5 10-5Z"/><path d="M6 12v5c0 1.1 2.7 2 6 2s6-.9 6-2v-5"/></svg></div><h4>Education</h4><p>Fee collection automation, payroll and grant compliance reporting for education institutions.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card card-dark reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M2 20V9l6 4V9l6 4V6l6 4v10Z"/><path d="M2 20h20"/></svg></div><h4>Manufacturing</h4><p>Production costing, raw material reconciliation and shop-floor KPI dashboards.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card card-dark reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/></svg></div><h4>Trading</h4><p>Multi-currency trading reconciliation, LC management and inventory valuation automation.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card card-dark reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M22 20V9l-10-6L2 9v11Z"/><path d="M6 20v-6h12v6"/></svg></div><h4>Warehousing</h4><p>Stock movement tracking, cycle counting and 3PL billing automation.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card card-dark reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20"/><path d="M9 22v-4h6v4"/><path d="M9 6h1"/><path d="M14 6h1"/><path d="M9 10h1"/><path d="M14 10h1"/><path d="M9 14h1"/><path d="M14 14h1"/></svg></div><h4>Hospitality</h4><p>Revenue reconciliation across booking channels and multi-property financial consolidation.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card card-dark reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M3 21h18"/><path d="M5 21V9"/><path d="M19 21V9"/><path d="M3 9l9-6 9 6"/><path d="M9 21v-7"/><path d="M15 21v-7"/></svg></div><h4>Government</h4><p>Budget tracking, grant compliance and transparent public reporting dashboards.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section on-dark">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:840px;">
    <div class="section-head center">
      <div class="eyebrow center" style="justify-content:center;">FAQ</div>
      <h2 class="headline">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-q">Do you build industry-specific dashboards? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></div>
        <div class="acc-a"><p>Yes — KPI frameworks are co-designed per industry. A logistics dashboard tracks cost-per-kilometre and fleet utilisation; a manufacturing dashboard tracks yield and machine downtime.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-q">Have you worked with companies our size before? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></div>
        <div class="acc-a"><p>We serve everything from single-entity SMEs to multi-entity groups with regional operations — our engagement scope adjusts to your complexity, not the other way around.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-q">Can one engagement cover multiple industries if we're diversified? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></div>
        <div class="acc-a"><p>Yes, several of our clients operate across logistics, trading and warehousing simultaneously — we build a unified reporting layer across all business lines.</p></div>
      </div></div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section-tight on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-band reveal">
      <h2 class="headline center" style="max-width:640px;position:relative;z-index:1;">Tell us your industry — we'll show you what's possible</h2>
      <p class="lede center" style="margin-top:16px;position:relative;z-index:1;">Book a free consultation and see a live example dashboard for a business like yours.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions center" style="justify-content:center;position:relative;z-index:1;">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-gold">Book Free Consultation <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline">Schedule Demo</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
